---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = 'Privacy Policy | Contractor Money Tools';
const pageDescription = 'Learn how Contractor Money Tools handles calculator data, Google Analytics usage data, and browser technologies.';
---

<SiteLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
  <header class="content-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>
      This policy explains how Contractor Money Tools handles information when
      you use contractormoneytools.com.
    </p>
  </header>

  <article class="content-card privacy-content">
    <section aria-labelledby="information-title">
      <h2 id="information-title">Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        Contractor Money Tools is a static website. It currently has no user
        accounts, login, database, contact form, newsletter, advertising,
        affiliate links, or payment processing.
      </p>
      <p>
        Google Analytics may collect normal website-usage information, such as
        pages viewed, device and browser information, approximate geographic
        information, traffic source, and interaction events.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="calculator-data-title">
      <h2 id="calculator-data-title">Calculator data</h2>
      <p>
        Calculator calculations run in your browser. Contractor Money Tools
        does not intentionally send financial values entered into calculator
        fields or calculated results to Google Analytics.
      </p>
      <p>
        Calculator fields are intended for business-planning numbers. Do not
        enter names, email addresses, account numbers, or other personal
        identifiers into calculator fields.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="analytics-title">
      <h2 id="analytics-title">Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        Contractor Money Tools uses Google Analytics 4, with measurement ID
        G-PS80221W71, to understand site usage and performance. Google Enhanced
        Measurement is enabled for this web stream.
      </p>
      <p>
        In addition to standard website measurements, the site records the
        event names <code>calculator_start</code>,
        <code>calculator_complete</code>, and
        <code>calculator_navigation</code>. Their custom payloads use
        calculator identifiers only—not financial input values or calculator
        results.
      </p>
      <p>
        Google may process analytics information under its own systems,
        policies, and terms. Contractor Money Tools does not control Google’s
        independent processing beyond this site’s Google Analytics configuration.
      </p>
      <p>
        On your first visit, the site asks whether you accept analytics. Your
        choice is stored in your browser so the question does not appear on
        every visit. If you accept, analytics storage is granted. If you
        decline, analytics storage remains denied and Google Analytics operates
        only within that denied consent state.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="cookies-title">
      <h2 id="cookies-title">Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
      <p>
        With your consent, Google Analytics may use cookies or similar browser
        technologies to measure visits and interactions. Until you accept,
        analytics storage defaults to denied. The site also stores your
        analytics-consent choice in browser storage. You can use your browser
        settings to block or delete cookies and local browser storage, although
        doing so may cause the site to ask for your choice again.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="third-parties-title">
      <h2 id="third-parties-title">Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        The only third-party tracking service currently installed is Google
        Analytics, provided by Google. No advertising, affiliate, payment,
        CRM, or other third-party tracking service is currently active.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="retention-title">
      <h2 id="retention-title">Data retention and control</h2>
      <p>
        Analytics-data retention and controls are subject to this site’s Google
        Analytics configuration and Google’s systems and policies. No specific
        retention period is promised here. You can manage cookies and similar
        browser storage through your browser settings.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="changes-title">
      <h2 id="changes-title">Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        This policy may be updated when the site’s features, service providers,
        or data practices change. The current version will be posted on this page.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="contact-title">
      <h2 id="contact-title">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Contact details will be added here when a public support channel is established.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .privacy-content { max-width: 54rem; }
  .privacy-content section + section { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 1.5rem; padding-top: 1.5rem; }
  .privacy-content section > p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  code { overflow-wrap: anywhere; color: var(--navy-deep); font-size: .9em; font-weight: 700; }
</style>
